What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
interface SoundEmitter {
    void emit();
}
class Siren implements SoundEmitter {
    public void emit() { System.out.print("Wail "); }
}
class Horn implements SoundEmitter {
    public void emit() { System.out.print("Beep "); }
}
public class SoundBoard {
    public static void playAll(SoundEmitter[] emitters) {
        for (SoundEmitter se : emitters) { se.emit(); }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SoundEmitter[] items = { new Siren(), new Horn() };
        playAll(items);
    }
}
```

