What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
abstract class TaxCalculator {
    public abstract double calc(double amount);
}
class FlatTax extends TaxCalculator {
    public double calc(double amount) { return amount * 0.10; }
}
class LuxuryTax extends TaxCalculator {
    public double calc(double amount) { return amount * 0.20; }
}
public class TaxBatch {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        java.util.List<TaxCalculator> list = java.util.Arrays.asList(new FlatTax(), new LuxuryTax());
        double sum = 0;
        for (TaxCalculator tc : list) {
            sum += tc.calc(100.0);
        }
        System.out.println((int) sum);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
class MessagePacket {
    public String getHeader() { return "HDR"; }
}
class EncryptedPacket extends MessagePacket {
    public String getKey() { return "KEY"; }
}
public class PacketRouter {
    public static void inspect(MessagePacket p) {
        System.out.print(p.getHeader());
        if (p instanceof EncryptedPacket ep) {
            System.out.print(":" + ep.getKey());
        }
        System.out.print(" ");
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        inspect(new MessagePacket());
        inspect(new EncryptedPacket());
    }
}
```

